              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya Musa kuhuma apelelezi kuupeleleza mudzi wa Jazeri, Aiziraeli auteka phamwenga na vidzidzivye na achiazola Aamori ariokala anasagala mumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
