          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi achimuolaga ye mfalume phamwenga na anae alume na jeshire rosi. Taphasarire hata mutu mmwenga, nao achiihala yo tsiiye.",
          "type": "text",
